1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:00,934
This 172-foot bomber

2
00:00:00,934 --> 00:00:01,788
weighs eighty tons,

3
00:00:01,788 --> 00:00:02,290
yet on radar

4
00:00:02,290 --> 00:00:02,742
it shrinks

5
00:00:02,742 --> 00:00:03,460
to a bumblebee.

6
00:00:03,750 --> 00:00:04,598
Normal jets bounce

7
00:00:04,598 --> 00:00:05,552
radar straight back,

8
00:00:05,552 --> 00:00:06,507
but stealth wings use

9
00:00:06,507 --> 00:00:07,408
flat origami angles

10
00:00:07,408 --> 00:00:08,760
that deflect
waves sideways.

11
00:00:09,080 --> 00:00:09,967
Even the engines

12
00:00:09,967 --> 00:00:10,664
stay hidden,

13
00:00:10,664 --> 00:00:11,361
deep S-shaped

14
00:00:11,361 --> 00:00:12,248
air tunnels bury

15
00:00:12,248 --> 00:00:13,641
the spinning
metal blades

16
00:00:13,641 --> 00:00:14,781
so radar gets trapped

17
00:00:14,781 --> 00:00:15,700
and dies inside.

18
00:00:16,020 --> 00:00:17,179
Then its dark carbon

19
00:00:17,179 --> 00:00:18,543
skin swallows leftover

20
00:00:18,543 --> 00:00:19,634
waves as tiny heat,

21
00:00:19,634 --> 00:00:20,725
shrinking the echo

22
00:00:20,725 --> 00:00:21,700
to a bumblebee.

23
00:00:22,020 --> 00:00:23,038
It isn't
sci-fi cloaking,

24
00:00:23,038 --> 00:00:23,903
just tilted mirrors

25
00:00:23,903 --> 00:00:24,920
scattering every pulse

26
00:00:24,920 --> 00:00:25,760
away from the dish.

27
00:00:26,080 --> 00:00:26,803
So by the time

28
00:00:26,803 --> 00:00:28,184
enemies finally
spot it,

29
00:00:28,184 --> 00:00:28,776
the bomber

30
00:00:28,776 --> 00:00:29,730
is already gone.
